<ans># Niva Bupa Health Insurance Ltd — H1FY25 Financial Data (Six Months Ended September 30, 2024)

## Summary of Sourcing Approach

I reviewed the statutory financial results PDF (dated September 30, 2024) as the primary source, since it carries the audited/reviewed IGAAP figures for H1FY25. The three corporate announcement PDFs — CO under Regulation 6(1), RTA under Regulation 7(1), and the Investor Grievance Report — were also opened and reviewed, but these contain only compliance-officer and RTA contact details plus shareholder-complaint counts. **No financial figures appear in those three documents**, so they contribute nothing to the data table below.

Total GWP (1/n statutory basis) and Retail health GWP were **not disclosed** in the statutory filing in a reliable form — only ex-1/n GWP growth percentages appeared in segment schedules, and retail-mix percentages exist only in the investor deck (not in ₹ crore terms). Per instructions, these are left blank rather than mixing bases.

