nts/2024-25/Press-Release-Q3-Results.pdf", "snippet": "On the back of higher than category growth rate, Niva Bupa\u2019s retail health market share has increased \u00b7 from 9.0% in 9MFY24 to <strong>9.6% in 9MFY25.</strong> The growth is basis contribution of many factors including \u00b7 company\u2019s retail digital business (including partners) which has grown by approx."}}}, "step14web10": {"step": 14, "title": "Niva Bupa \u2018very comfortable\u2019 with group health segment constituting around 30% of portfolio, says CFO Vishwanath M - The HinduBusinessLine", "toolName": "WebSearch", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/money-and-banking/niva-bupa-very-comfortable-with-group-health-segment-constituting-around-30-of-portfolio-says-cfo-vishwanath-m/article70966827.ece", "citation_key": "step14web10", "snippet": "The company\u2019s retail health insurance market share improved from <strong>9.2 per cent</strong> in FY25 to 10.1 per cent in FY26.", "raw_data": {"search_result": {"title": "Niva Bupa \u2018very comfortable\u2019 with group health segment constituting around 30% of portfolio, says CFO Vishwanath M - The HinduBusinessLine", "link": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/money-and-banking/niva-bupa-very-comfortable-with-group-health-segment-constituting-around-30-of-portfolio-says-cfo-vishwanath-m/article70966827.ece", "snippet": "The company\u2019s retail health insurance market share improved from <strong>9.2 per cent</strong> in FY25 to 10.1 per cent in FY26."}}}, "step18_PythonRepl12": {"step": 18, "title": "Python Execution: \n# Converting Rs. in Lakhs to INR Crore (1 crore = 100 lakhs) from the Sep 30, 2024 statutory filing...", "toolName": "PythonRepl", "snippet": "Output: \"Will verify manually with clean figures from Balance Sheet, Ratios Annexure, and Segment Reporting\\n\"...", "raw_data": {"code": "\n# Converting Rs. in Lakhs to INR Crore (1 crore = 100 lakhs) from the Sep 30, 2024 statutory filing\n# Year to date ended September 30, 