: -5.8\\nInvestments - Shareholders Sep30,2024: 2564.74\\nInvestments - Policyholders Sep30,2024: 3400.47\\nTotal Investments Sep30,2024: 5965.21\\nEoM to NWP ratio H1FY25: 50.95%\\nSolvency - not disclosed as ratio value in this statement (only debt-equity etc shown)\\n\""}}}</sources>
